  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "John David led the family enterprise that became one of Australia’s largest grocery distributors. He equipped independent supermarkets to compete with national chains, assembled regional wholesalers and brought IGA to the country. The company’s public-market expansion ultimately passed to South Africa’s Metro Cash & Carry, creating the corporate foundation of today’s Metcash group.",
